WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.334
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.400
This is "Late Night".
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.634
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:08.734
President Biden is said to have
his annual physical

00:00:08.734 --> 00:00:09.734
later this month.

00:00:09.734 --> 00:00:12.868
Well, at least that's one probe
that won't turn up

00:00:12.868 --> 00:00:14.000
any documents.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.501 --> 00:00:19.667
God willing.

00:00:19.667 --> 00:00:21.767
The FBI reportedly searched
President Biden's

00:00:21.767 --> 00:00:23.100
Delaware beach house today

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:24.834
as part of the ongoing
investigation

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:26.801
into his handling
of classified documents.

00:00:26.801 --> 00:00:28.868
And I think he might
be getting nervous,

00:00:28.868 --> 00:00:31.434
because he said, "You know what
you should be searching?

00:00:31.434 --> 00:00:34.868
Hunter's laptop.

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:36.200
Crazy stuff in there."

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:40.434
Democratic Congressman
Jamie Raskin asked

00:00:40.434 --> 00:00:43.367
the Secret Service yesterday
to turn over visitor logs

00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:46.367
to Mar-a-Lago and former
Vice President Mike Pence's

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:47.367
Indiana home.

00:00:47.367 --> 00:00:48.467
Let me save you the time --

00:00:48.467 --> 00:00:50.834
Domino's guy and no one.

00:00:50.834 --> 00:00:53.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.734 --> 00:00:56.567
The Biden administration
proposed new rules today

00:00:56.567 --> 00:00:58.567
that would limit
credit card company fees

00:00:58.567 --> 00:00:59.634
for missed payments.

00:00:59.634 --> 00:01:02.934
"Oh, I never charge anything,"
said Merrick Garland.

00:01:02.934 --> 00:01:05.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.801 --> 00:01:07.367
[ Audience murmurs ]

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:09.133
[ Groans ]

00:01:09.934 --> 00:01:12.534
According to a new poll,
15% of voters said

00:01:12.534 --> 00:01:13.601
that the most important problem

00:01:13.601 --> 00:01:15.300
facing the county's inflation --

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.968
oh, wait, now it's 20%?

00:01:16.968 --> 00:01:19.133
Oh, God, now it's 25-- 30%?

00:01:19.133 --> 00:01:20.834
Oh, my God, you know what?
I'm gonna stop looking.

00:01:20.834 --> 00:01:22.467
I'm gonna just stop looking.

00:01:23.634 --> 00:01:25.601
Authorities in Texas
yesterday located

00:01:25.601 --> 00:01:29.567
the two emperor tamarin monkeys
that went from the Dallas Zoo

00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:32.100
inside the closet
of an abandoned home.

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:34.434
And they left them there because
at this point,

00:01:34.434 --> 00:01:37.067
that's a more secure location
than the Dallas Zoo.

00:01:37.067 --> 00:01:39.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:41.634
Tomorrow is groundhog day,
which is weird,

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:44.634
'cause we still haven't had
the first six weeks of winter.

00:01:44.634 --> 00:01:46.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.934 --> 00:01:49.868
According to new analysis,
the price of beef is expected

00:01:49.868 --> 00:01:53.367
to increase this year by 15%,
so it's gonna be weird

00:01:53.367 --> 00:01:56.033
when the price
of a Quarter Pounder doesn't.

00:01:56.033 --> 00:02:00.267
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:02.434
Then what is it?

00:02:02.434 --> 00:02:04.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.734 --> 00:02:07.400
And finally, the candy executive
who's credited

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:10.234
as the father of Peeps, for
creating the marshmallow treat,

00:02:10.234 --> 00:02:12.501
died recently at the age of 98.

00:02:12.501 --> 00:02:15.634
And his last words were, "Please
don't let them call me

00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:16.968
the father of Peeps."

00:02:16.968 --> 00:02:19.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.133 --> 00:02:20.300
That was a monologue, everybody.

